What is polling?

Suppose the user submits a repo.

Backend responds:
{
  "job_id": "123"
}
The frontend wants to know:
Is it done yet?

One way
Frontend
    ↓
GET /jobs/123

3 seconds later

GET /jobs/123

3 seconds later

GET /jobs/123

3 seconds later

GET /jobs/123

This is polling.

The frontend repeatedly asks:

Are we there yet?

Like a child in a car. 😄

What is SSE?
Frontend
    ↓
Open connection

Backend
    ↓
status = RUNNING
    ↓
push update

Backend
    ↓
status = COMPLETE
    ↓
push update

The server tells the client when something changes.

No repeated requests.

This is called:

Server Side Events (SSE)
